# Data stays local: raw and full-text sources, releases, silver records, indexes and run artifacts are large or
# license-restricted (spec §31, §32). Only the JSON schemas and the evaluation reports cited in the project README are
# published. The BM25 artifact is rebuilt from the database by scripts/retrieval/build_bm25.py.
data/*
!data/schemas/
!data/reports/
data/reports/*
!data/reports/retrieval_eval_v0.2.0.md
!data/reports/retrieval_eval_v0.2.0.json
!data/reports/grounding_eval_v0.2.0.md
!data/reports/grounding_eval_v0.2.0.json
!data/reports/routing_bench_v0.2.0.md
!data/reports/routing_bench_v0.2.0.json
!data/reports/laya_eval.md
!data/reports/laya_eval.json
!data/reports/cache_bench_v0.2.0.md
!data/reports/cache_bench_v0.2.0.json

